    "reason": "[ev-887b12a31841] and [ev-8fea3a0e7308] say `experimental.ruler.enable-api` is removed and that `ruler.enable-api` should be used instead. The name uses Loki's dotted, hyphenated CLI-flag style, the same style as the other upgrade-guide items that are explicitly called CLI flags [ev-dc20110f4f4b][ev-03b4fbe630df]. It is not a Helm values key, so a values-key predicate on that path would never match a real environment. Exposure should be the old flag being set on Loki's containers. Confidence is low because the evidence never literally calls it a CLI flag.",
